    {
      "id": "claim_04d5095aec0e4113b8dc4c4daf167f18",
      "statement": "The filter is one recursive operator-discriminated grammar, MetadataPredicate<Condition>, instantiated for documents (MetadataFilter, fields are metadata keys) and for metadata entries (MetadataMatch, fields are key or value); parseMetadataFilter and parseMetadataMatch share one walker and differ only by record type.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/metadata-filter.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:8e34a7016f81643af69aff8366ef778b84d3746a014f5c628694b0e00f532e95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_591c82600f1f43bab294081070906ef8",
      "statement": "The accepted operator set is and, or, not, eq, ne, gt, gte, lt, lte, in, nin, all, contains, prefix, suffix, type, and exists; caseInsensitive is an optional flag rather than an operator, accepted only on string or string-array operands and rejected on exists and type.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/metadata-filter.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:8e34a7016f81643af69aff8366ef778b84d3746a014f5c628694b0e00f532e95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
